                <p>• <code style="background:var(--green-pale);color:var(--green-dark);padding:.1rem .3rem;border-radius:6px;">new HelloComponent()</code> — <strong style="color:var(--ink);">fresh object in browser RAM</strong></p>
                <p>• <code style="background:var(--green-pale);color:var(--green-dark);padding:.1rem .3rem;border-radius:6px;">ngOnInit()</code> runs — platform = "Browser"</p>
                <p>• Hydration: Angular finds existing DOM nodes — no recreation</p>
                <p>• onClick wired → <code style="background:var(--green-pale);color:var(--green-dark);padding:.1rem .3rem;border-radius:6px;">addEventListener("click")</code> on &lt;button&gt;</p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

